{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"also I love the idea of having a \"safe space\" channel that's specifically designed to be smaller. The beauty of the rooftop channel was that there were hardly ever more than 3 or 4 of us up there, so as a new player it was a lot more manageable than say, the streets of London or the pub. I love all those names too 💖","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:16:48.008000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747867086029586442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
