{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"my issue with the rooftops was, it encouraged cliques, and felt very exclusive.  Basically if you didnt have a reason to randomly climb up there, they became people you never got a chance to interact with.  likewise, they had little reason to descend and interact unless there was an event.","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:24:59.067000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747869145680314429","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
