{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Granted. Roof Top Haven was perhaps an overcorrection on my part, but I don't like it when folks tell each other that they are having the wrong kinds of fun.","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:27:55.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747869884893102191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"And I wanted to provide a place where people who didn't want to be mobbed by folks could feel like it was private.","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:28:28.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747870024764489729","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
