{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"What Heki said is entirely fair. That's why part of my character's arc was being comfortable going places. But it was also one of my favorite little moments in the game. Leaf, Skitter, and Note were with some others in the streets, it started raining and while the other half of the group went inside to get out of the cold, the three of them stayed outside enjoying the rain. Instant best friends right there.","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:30:53.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747870631634403408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"White knighting was also an issue.","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:31:27.390000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747870774425288786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"keep in mind im not criticizing RTG at all.  It was exactly what you all needed it seems, but there were hours in week 1 where i wanted to talk to someone, and every active player was in the rooftops","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:35:03.533000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-25T17:35:22.809000Z","id":"747871680994476112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
