{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"it was fixed by the format change, but with the s4 format being differant (no boat forcing more mixing) it becomes something the DMs have to be careful of","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:38:21.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747872511236243548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"dang I'm sorry that happened. Thinking back, I can definitely see how that would be frustrating. I think might have an idea? We could have a channel that's literally just a single table or park bench. If a new player is feeling overwhelmed trying to rp with a bunch of people, they can sit there and have a more one on one conversation with whoever chooses to sit down at the time","created_at":"2020-08-25T17:38:45.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747872613552095432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
